m&oh=00_AfuWYi6LfA7ve6XSu5h_iyj7zd8UAahXHNwitCh-0urp6w&oe=699C315E"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "500203477316600", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974708_317856575534629_3633437307580710912_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fEalJVkEcfYQ7kNvwHvnppA&_nc_oc=AdmuKaSc_jyxWgQX-auAd-rTSDJRNkXemz7kGU2HJQltCh_kGsjZra3v0TgT_i2ye4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs1p2224yJIIdUGekCaakR7j3idwQfx9Bj30SYuDecj7A&oe=699C65BC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/IiQnJg", "id": "2129494757144720", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974745_2129494760478053_4652084631137419264_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Uqspy8hooQsQ7kNvwGP5twC&_nc_oc=AdkUYjvn33HOG5xsXew7VH9zxAXLsOeUXdwEID2573G1zjsxsv_b-jEEGob-KYZaE-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsVIhJ6HAcNggTT5hBTJJdKQ37IeUHuDV9AKrB5bMsQ4w&oe=699C5919"}, "display_name": "Marshall From Detroit", "keywords": ["Felix", "Eminem", "Marshall", "Detroit", "Music"], "long_description": "Growing up, Marshall Mathers dreamed of rapping his way out of Detroit. Years and fortunes later, he still hasn\u2019t left. Now in this intimate VR experience, take a surreal ride on a cold winter night with Sway Calloway and Eminem himself. Witness Detroit as never before as the two old friends swap stories, discuss dreams and keep it 100. Detroit is a land of historic paradoxes: a cornerstone of commerce, a post-industrial nightmare, a bastion of music, a cautionary tale. But to many it remains a symbol of strength, grit and reincarnation. With a front row seat down memory lane, this lyrical experience offers an unprecedented glimpse into its eponymous titans. Marshall From Detroit is an atmospheric study of a legend, his hometown, and how a place can shape you.", "short_description": "Growing up, Marshall Mathers dreamed of rapping his way out of Detroit. Years and fortunes later, he 